menu "RoboHub DHT11 driver"

config RH_DRV_DHT11
    bool "DHT11 temperature and humidity sensor"
    select RH_HAL_DHT
    select RH_HAL_TIMER
    default n
    help
      The Aosong DHT11 temperature and humidity sensor, reached through the
      single-wire HAL and a timer the selected platform implements. An
      application that sets this gets the driver compiled in; one that does not
      pays for none of it.

endmenu
